{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your horizons with \u201cMap Pack 4\u201d from the community creator Uncle Ron. This Content Creator Pack introduces new maps, each inspired by iconic rivers, dramatic landscapes, and breathtaking coastlines. From tropical archipelagos to alpine fjords, these maps and 10 new intersections let you create your next city in a unique but realistic setting.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2018Map Pack 4\u2019 includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 New River and Landscape themed Maps (3 Temperate, 2 Tropical, 3 European, 2 Boreal)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 New Intersections</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack can be bought as part of the <strong>\u2018Shops of Shibuya Bundle\u2019\u00a0</strong>containing <strong>\u2018Shops of Shibuya\u2019</strong>, <strong>\u2018Map Pack 4\u2019</strong>, and <strong>\u2018Harumi Nights FM\u2019</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731510?t=1757491177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731510/70a3cfb2507daab40dc27f002fb47e69203b2ac4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757491177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731510/aac81eba84c090f4e22ead6b410135aa08b9ff76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757491177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731510/aac81eba84c090f4e22ead6b410135aa08b9ff76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757491177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"co